# The Algebra of Forgetting: An Interactive Journey

Every finite stream belongs to a vast world of possible histories, but a bounded memory can display only finitely many states. Begin with the collision lab and watch the [pigeonhole principle](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pigeonhole_principle) turn this mismatch into an unavoidable repeated state.

